<article class="k-doc" data-k-figs="79a1095e" data-doc="note">
<header class="k-title">
<h1>Интерактивные рисунки</h1>
<ul class="k-tags">
<li>рисунки</li>
<li>фикстура</li></ul></header>
<p>График с ползунками и поверхность с вращением: в PDF и без JS — кадр при значениях по умолчанию, в приложении — живой рисунок.</p>
<h2 class="k-h k-h2" id="График-с-параметрами" data-k-anchor="График-с-параметрами"><span class="k-num">1</span>График с параметрами</h2>
<figure>
<div class="k-plot" data-k-plot="{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;2d&quot;,&quot;curves&quot;:[{&quot;f&quot;:&quot;a * calc.sin(b * x)&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;line&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:null,&quot;dashed&quot;:false}],&quot;x&quot;:[-5.0,5.0],&quot;y&quot;:[-3.0,3.0],&quot;params&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;a&quot;,&quot;min&quot;:0.0,&quot;max&quot;:3.0,&quot;step&quot;:0.1,&quot;value&quot;:1.0},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;b&quot;,&quot;min&quot;:0.5,&quot;max&quot;:4.0,&quot;step&quot;:0.1,&quot;value&quot;:1.0}],&quot;labels&quot;:[&quot;x&quot;,&quot;y&quot;],&quot;width&quot;:8,&quot;height&quot;:5}">
<div class="k-frame k-fig">
<svg style="overflow: visible; width: 20.615604868em; height: 12.884753042em; display: block" viewBox="0 0 226.771653543 141.732283465" width="226.771653543pt" height="141.732283465pt" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:h5="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">…8665 байт, fnv 2f99d5bd8accb940…</svg></div>
<div class="k-plot-values">a = 1, b = 1</div></div>
<figcaption><span class="k-fig-num">Рис. 1.</span> Синусоида: амплитуда <math><mi>𝑎</mi></math> и частота <math><mi>𝑏</mi></math></figcaption></figure>
<h2 class="k-h k-h2" id="Несколько-кривых-и-разрывы" data-k-anchor="Несколько-кривых-и-разрывы"><span class="k-num">2</span>Несколько кривых и разрывы</h2>
<figure>
<div class="k-plot" data-k-plot="{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;2d&quot;,&quot;curves&quot;:[{&quot;f&quot;:&quot;calc.tan(x)&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;line&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;tg x&quot;,&quot;dashed&quot;:false},{&quot;f&quot;:&quot;1 / (x - c)&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;second&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:&quot;1/(x−c)&quot;,&quot;dashed&quot;:true},{&quot;f&quot;:&quot;calc.sqrt(x)&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;third&quot;,&quot;label&quot;:null,&quot;dashed&quot;:false}],&quot;x&quot;:[-4.0,4.0],&quot;y&quot;:[-4.0,4.0],&quot;params&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;c&quot;,&quot;min&quot;:-2.0,&quot;max&quot;:2.0,&quot;step&quot;:0.04,&quot;value&quot;:1.0}],&quot;labels&quot;:[&quot;x&quot;,&quot;y&quot;],&quot;width&quot;:8,&quot;height&quot;:5}">
<div class="k-frame k-fig">
<svg style="overflow: visible; width: 20.615604868em; height: 12.884753042em; display: block" viewBox="0 0 226.771653543 141.732283465" width="226.771653543pt" height="141.732283465pt" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:h5="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">…10530 байт, fnv 2a1f9d38e187ef04…</svg></div>
<div class="k-plot-legend"><span class="k-plot-key" style="color: var(--k-fig-line)">— tg x</span><span class="k-plot-key" style="color: var(--k-fig-second)">- - 1/(x−c)</span></div>
<div class="k-plot-values">c = 1</div></div>
<figcaption><span class="k-fig-num">Рис. 2.</span> Асимптоты рвут кривую, корень определён только при <math><mi>𝑥</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></math></figcaption></figure>
<h2 class="k-h k-h2" id="Поверхность" data-k-anchor="Поверхность"><span class="k-num">3</span>Поверхность</h2>
<figure>
<div class="k-plot" data-k-plot="{&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;3d&quot;,&quot;f&quot;:&quot;calc.sin(k * x) * calc.cos(y)&quot;,&quot;x&quot;:[-3.0,3.0],&quot;y&quot;:[-3.0,3.0],&quot;z&quot;:[-1.0,1.0],&quot;params&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;k&quot;,&quot;min&quot;:0.2,&quot;max&quot;:2.0,&quot;step&quot;:0.1,&quot;value&quot;:1.0}],&quot;labels&quot;:[&quot;x&quot;,&quot;y&quot;,&quot;z&quot;],&quot;n&quot;:24,&quot;style&quot;:&quot;shaded&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;face&quot;,&quot;view&quot;:[-30,28],&quot;size&quot;:3}">
<div class="k-frame k-fig">
<svg style="overflow: visible; width: 10.560539986em; height: 10.659272621em; display: block" viewBox="0 0 116.165939849 117.251998829" width="116.165939849pt" height="117.251998829pt" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xmlns:h5="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">…153516 байт, fnv 3359e0341b16f282…</svg></div>
<div class="k-plot-values">k = 1</div></div>
<figcaption><span class="k-fig-num">Рис. 3.</span> Поверхность <math><mi>𝑧</mi><mo>=</mo><mo form="prefix" lspace="0em" rspace="0.16666666666666666em">sin</mo><mi>𝑘</mi><mi>𝑥</mi><mo form="prefix" lspace="0.16666666666666666em" rspace="0.16666666666666666em">cos</mo><mi>𝑦</mi></math></figcaption></figure>
<h2 class="k-h k-h2" id="Сверка-вычислений" data-k-anchor="Сверка-вычислений"><span class="k-num">4</span>Сверка вычислений</h2>
<p>Эти значения посчитал Typst; клиент (<code>app/src/lib/plot/</code>) сверяет с ними свой разборщик (Vitest читает снимок этой заметки).</p>
<pre class="k-plot-check">[{"f":"x * x - 3 * x + 2","vars":{"x":1.5},"value":-0.25},{"f":"-x * -2","vars":{"x":3.0},"value":6.0},{"f":"-calc.pow(x, 2)","vars":{"x":3.0},"value":-9.0},{"f":"2 - 3 - 4 + 1","vars":{},"value":-4.0},{"f":"12 / 3 / 2","vars":{},"value":2.0},{"f":"1 / x","vars":{"x":0.0},"value":null},{"f":"calc.sqrt(x)","vars":{"x":-1.0},"value":null},{"f":"calc.ln(x) + calc.log(x)","vars":{"x":100.0},"value":6.605170185988092},{"f":"calc.asin(x) + calc.acos(x) + calc.atan(x)","vars":{"x":0.3},"value":1.8622531212727638},{"f":"calc.asin(x)","vars":{"x":1.5},"value":null},{"f":"calc.exp(x)","vars":{"x":800.0},"value":null},{"f":"calc.exp(-x) * calc.cos(a * x)","vars":{"x":1.2,"a":2.5},"value":-0.29818000981256454},{"f":"calc.pow(x, 1 / 3)","vars":{"x":-8.0},"value":null},{"f":"calc.pow(x, 3)","vars":{"x":-2.0},"value":-8.0},{"f":"calc.pow(0, -1)","vars":{},"value":null},{"f":"calc.floor(x) + calc.ceil(x) + calc.abs(-x)","vars":{"x":2.5},"value":7.5},{"f":"calc.pi * calc.e","vars":{},"value":8.539734222673566},{"f":"1e3 + 2.5e-1","vars":{},"value":1000.25},{"f":"calc.tan(x) / calc.sin(x) * calc.cos(x)","vars":{"x":0.7},"value":1.0},{"f":"(x + y) * (x - y)","vars":{"x":3.0,"y":2.0},"value":5.0}]</pre></article>
